\lispPackageChapter{chorus/api/timer}

Timers are built from CUDA events. \texttt{chorus/api} reexports this package.

\lispFunctionSubsection{create-timer}

\lispSyntax

\texttt{(create-timer)}

\lispFunctionSubsection{destroy-timer}

Destroys a timer.

\lispFunctionSubsection{start-timer}

Records the start event.

\lispFunctionSubsection{stop-timer}

Records the stop event.

\lispFunctionSubsection{synchronize-timer}

Waits for the timer's events.

\lispFunctionSubsection{elapsed-time}

\lispSyntax

\texttt{(elapsed-time \lispVar{timer})}

\lispMacroSubsection{with-timer}

\lispSyntax

\texttt{(with-timer (\lispVar{var}) \&body \lispVar{body})}

Binds \texttt{var} to a new timer and destroys it on the way out.
